><span begin="01:33.270" end="01:33.930">feels </span><span begin="01:33.930" end="01:34.470">out </span><span begin="01:34.470" end="01:35.550">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.970" end="01:40.530"><span begin="01:35.970" end="01:36.300">She </span><span begin="01:36.300" end="01:36.630">said</span><span begin="01:36.630" end="01:36.630">, </span><span begin="01:36.630" end="01:36.660">"</span><span begin="01:36.660" end="01:37.050">Not </span><span begin="01:37.050" end="01:37.230">if </span><span begin="01:37.230" end="01:37.620">you're </span><span begin="01:37.620" end="01:37.710">a </span><span begin="01:37.710" end="01:40.080">millionaire</span><span begin="01:40.080" end="01:40.110"> </span><span begin="01:40.110" end="01:40.140">"</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.530" end="01:44.670"><span begin="01:40.530" end="01:40.920">And </span><span begin="01:40.920" end="01:40.980">I </span><span begin="01:40.980" end="01:41.490">swear </span><span begin="01:41.490" end="01:41.580">I </span><span begin="01:41.580" end="01:42.060">fell </span><span begin="01:42.060" end="01:42.210">in </span><span begin="01:42.210" end="01:42.750">love </span><span begin="01:42.750" end="01:42.810"> </span><span begin="01:42.810" end="01:43.290">right </span><span begin="01:43.290" end="01:43.350"> </span><span begin="01:43.350" end="01:44.370">there </span><span begin="01:44.370" end="01:44.610">（</span><span begin="01:44.610" end="01:44.670">Yeah</span><span begin="01:44.670" end="01:44.670">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.670" end="01:45.690"><span begin="01:44.670" end="01:44.783">[</span><span begin="01:44.783" end="01:44.896">Pre</span><span begin="01:44.896" end="01:45.009">-</span><span begin="01:45.009" end="01:45.122">Chorus</span><span begin="01:45.122" end="01:45.235">: </span><span begin="01:45.235" end="01:45.348">Christian </span><span begin="01:45.348" end="01:45.461">Anthony</span><span begin="01:45.461" end="01:45.574">]</span></p><p